sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind = Recurring)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId = <Configured evseId><br>AND chargingProfile.stackLevel = <Configured stackLevel><br>AND chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose = TxDefaultProfile<br>AND chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod.startPeriod = 0<br>AND chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind = Recurring<br>AND chargingProfile.recurrencyKind = <Configured recurrencyKind>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
